  "question": {
    "html": "<p>The graph shows the variation of electric field strength <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"E\"></span> with distance <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"r\"></span> from a point charge.</p>\n<p><figure data-asset-id=\"fig_01\"><img alt=\"Source question diagram 1\" src=\"asset:fig_01\"/></figure></p>\n<p>The shaded area X is the area under the graph between two separations <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"r_{1}\"></span> and <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"r_{2}\"></span> from the charge.</p>\n<p>What is X?</p>\n<p>[1]</p>\n<ol class=\"mcq-options\"><li data-label=\"A\">The electric field average between <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"r_{1}\"></span> and <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"r_{2}\"></span></li><li data-label=\"B\">The electric potential difference between <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"r_{1}\"></span> and <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"r_{2}\"></span></li><li data-label=\"C\">The work done in moving a charge from <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"r_{1}\"></span> to <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"r_{2}\"></span></li><li data-label=\"D\">The work done in moving a charge from <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"r_{2}\"></span> to <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"r_{1}\"></span></li></ol>"
  },
